# Prose and third-party content — Prettier is for source, not for these.
#
# `docs/` in particular must stay out: a blanket `prettier --write docs/` was tried on 2026-07-21 and it
# CORRUPTED content in files whose markdown sits at the edge of the spec — multi-line code spans get
# re-paired (032-night-and-lights lost `build-clump`, `nightColor`, `prelitColorAttribute`), `<type>_<city>`
# became `<type>*<city>` inside a code span (035-city-zones), and bold spans wrapping a line came back as
# literal `\*\*` (038-sa-prelit-lighting, 039-ide-object-flags). Reflowing prose is also pure diff noise on
# documents that are read, not compiled.

.claude
docs
blog
blog-src
mods-src
game-src
